+- `CHANGES.md` phase-2 section (`evidence-phase2.md:22-56`) accurately describes the grammar, the error decisions and the test count; the reported 11 tests match the `npm test` output at `evidence-phase2.md:76-78`.
+- `src/evaluate.mjs:38` reports `text.length` as the index for an unclosed parenthesis at end of input; the entry does not require an index in evaluator `SyntaxError` messages, so this is extra rather than required.
